INSERT INTO workflow_log VALUES('0776c65f-deb6-46e2-8a5b-33bc387c6908',NULL,'c2d9e4f1-3a6b-4c52-8e7d-9f1a0b2c3d45','2026-06-14T21:22:02Z','2026-06-14T21:22:02Z','scribe','orchestrator','implement-feature','88cebc4c-4e17-4ed6-b8de-aa9babf0a8f9',NULL,'docs/maintainer/workflow/20260615_054821_npm-publish検証と手順整備',NULL,'docs/maintainer/workflow/20260615_054821_npm-publish検証と手順整備/03_実装計画.md','["docs/maintainer/RELEASE.md","README.md"]','npm publish 検証と手順整備(implement-feature T1-T6)。検証(実publish禁止・mktemp隔離・本リポ非破壊): T1前提=npm10.8.2/node20.19.5(OK)。T2 SC-1 verify-npm-pack.sh exit0(170files・リーク0件・必須物すべて充足)。T3 SC-2 npm publish --dry-run exit0(public access反映・LICENSE同梱・解決すべき警告なし。loginは dry-run定型表示)。T4 SC-3 npm pack tarball を mktemp -d 展開し package/bin/agents-md.js の shebang #!/usr/bin/env node・実行権限 -rwxr-xr-x・version=0.1.0 exit0・help exit0 を確認し後始末済。文書化: T5 docs/maintainer/RELEASE.md 新設(前提→sync-version→verify-npm-pack→publish --dry-run→(承認後)タグpushによるCI publish。実publishはユーザー承認前提・NPM_TOKEN必須・検証フェーズでは実publishしないを明記。内部参照リンク8件すべて実在)。T6 README §リリース手順を RELEASE.md 入口リンク+要約へ整理し詳細重複を排除(README→RELEASE.md リンク実在)。SC-1〜SC-4 充足。実publish非実施・push非実施。',1,'16d4c9cb04ebc7443bf7ec9922772788c055ccfc9215b0e8503d127eb1724133','60ed3ed6829dd71a3f7bf24e6227ed221a256757b9bce5ea0588b8a2a4df1333',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
